    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate small interconnected tunnel networks by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths, unlock shortcuts and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse the tunnels of cultists and creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate small interconnected tunnel networks by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths, unlock shortcuts and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.poster.avif?t=1754579780\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.webm?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.mp4?t=1754579780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse the tunnels of cultists and creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "PSX-styled survival horror FPS meets point-and-click adventure game. You are bound to a sinister conveyor mechanism. Reach for weapons and items, navigate labyrinthine tunnels, and blast your path to worthiness!",
